void showMd(String p,bool top=false){md.setTopOffset(top?20:0);md.resetForRender();File f=LittleFS.open(p,"r");if(!f){display.setCursor(10,50);display.print("Cannot open document.");md.setMoreContent(false);return;}while(f.available()){String l=f.readStringUntil('\n');l.replace("\r","");md.parseBlock(l);if(md.pastViewport())break;}md.setMoreContent(f.available());f.close();}
void showClock(){tm n;if(!local(n)){DeviceUi::clockApp(display,focus,false,"","","","","","","","",cfg.unfocus,radioMark(),radio==ONLINE?WiFi.RSSI():0);return;}lastClockDay=n.tm_yday;int hour=n.tm_hour;String meridiem;if(cfg.twelve){meridiem=hour>=12?"PM":"AM";hour%=12;if(!hour)hour=12;}char dayText[8],monthText[8],yearText[6];strftime(dayText,sizeof(dayText),"%a",&n);strftime(monthText,sizeof(monthText),"%b",&n);strftime(yearText,sizeof(yearText),"%Y",&n);String day=dayText,month=monthText;day.toUpperCase();month.toUpperCase();DeviceUi::clockApp(display,focus,true,two(hour),two(n.tm_min),meridiem,day,two(n.tm_mday),month,yearText,dateString(),cfg.unfocus,radioMark(),radio==ONLINE?WiFi.RSSI():0);}
